WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.474 line:84%
To ask for directions, say: Where is the station? Where is the bus stand?

00:00:06.474 --> 00:00:09.205 line:84%
Straight, right, left, near, and far.

00:00:10.205 --> 00:00:14.227 line:84%
Go straight, then turn left. The hotel is near.

00:00:15.227 --> 00:00:18.678 line:84%
Now say: Please tell me the way to the hotel.
